  "summary": "Merlin Chain leverages a Zero-Knowledge (ZK) Rollup architecture built on Polygon CDK and powered by Lumoz's decentralized ZK-PoW prover network. This design decouples transaction execution from Bitcoin's slow Layer-1 consensus, drastically increasing throughput and lowering costs while anchoring state roots cryptographically to Bitcoin's native ledger via Taproot and multi-party threshold signatures.",
